Also maybe heist-head order irrelevant (outside grid).

Need action panel not have position sticky at <=900 already static.

Then compaction:
.heist-head { margin-bottom: 12px; }
.heist-head h1 32px maybe.
target-band padding 11px 12px.
target-art maybe 76 at mobile currently 88; target h2 28. Could reduce to 70 and h2 24.
map panel padding 10px 12px, map-track margin 10px 8px 8px, height 34.
alert panel padding 10px 12px, alert head strong 22, bar margin 7px 0 6px.
action panel padding 11px 11px 10px; action-grid maybe 2 columns until 560 (currently 1 col at 560) - at 390 1 col leads 6*48=288 height, too tall. Better keep 2 columns at mobile (remove 1fr rule) to keep actions compact. At 390 width each ~170 works with small text. Current 2-col at 760 and then 1-col at 560. Let's change 560 rule action-grid to 1fr 1fr. Or set 2 columns always. Could also make ball and bail span 2 columns? Not necessary.

Action button min-height 46 and padding 7px. ha-copy em 5.5px maybe truncation. At 170 width: columns 13+27+ copy + badge ~24 + gaps 18 + padding 14 = 96 + copy 74. "reach the target first" too long but ellipsis. Fine. Could hide ha-key at 560 to save 19px. But keys matter. Keep.

Footer mobile: grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; .hf-cell third child grid-column 1/-1 border-top. Add rules. At <=560 single column? 2 cols okay. To reduce height use 1fr 1fr; third full. Fine.

Also body.in-heist .view padding bottom 18px.

